  "body": "The steps for [insertAdjacentText](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-element-insertadjacenttext) insert a text node into an element. I don't think this can cause CEReactions because it will not cause attributes to change, elements to be created or adopted, or elements to be attached to or removed from the document.\n\nIt is functionally equivalent to to over-specify the CEReactions attribute, but since there was a decision not to apply CEReactions universally it probably makes sense to remove it from insertAdjacentText.\n",
